cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "strainselect: Select Bacterial Strains to Sequence Based on Their Metadata"
abstract: >-
  R package that helps choosing which bacterial strains to sequence from a
  collection described by categorical metadata, using either a clustering
  method (Gower distance, hierarchical clustering and silhouette width) or a
  profile method (one strain per group of strains with identical metadata).
